spec ww03-blind-increment-lpg: 2 sessions, 6 permutations
# WW03 through the lpg API: each increment reads through WriterViewOf(tx).

starting permutation: s1i s1c s2i s2c
step s1i: lpg: SetNodeProperty(c, n, n + 1)
step s1c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s2i: lpg: SetNodeProperty(c, n, n + 1)
ERROR: serialization conflict
step s2c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
ERROR: serialization conflict
final final: MATCH (c:Counter {name:'c'}) RETURN c.n AS n
